1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:04,460
The Golden Duo of Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun...

2
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:09,840
have finally returned to the world stage together.

3
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:14,300
They scored a precious goal against Europe's flawless number one keeper,

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:19,770
Gino Hernandez-kun.

5
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:22,940
and brought the match to a tie.

6
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,360
They did it. It's a tie!

7
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,860
Misaki-kun!

8
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,610
Tsubasa.

9
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,240
Taro.

10
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,660
Your teamwork was great, Misaki-kun.

11
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,700
Your shot was great too, Tsubasa-kun.

12
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:38,910
We did it! You did it, Tsubasa - Misaki!

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,830
We tied it up! We finally got it!

14
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,920
Your teamwork was amazing, number 10, number 11.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,840
If you can beat a favorite like Italy, it'll be an epic victory.

16
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:27,150
Episode 11: The Furious Tiger Awakens

17
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,430
G-Gino.

18
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:31,970
I'm fine.

19
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,970
Guys, stay calm.

20
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,970
They haven't taken the lead yet.

21
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:38,810
Listen, only Tardelli stays up front as forward.

22
00:02:38,890 --> 00:02:42,980
The rest of you move to midfield and mark numbers 10 and 11.

23
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:45,690
Don't let those two do anything.

24
00:02:45,780 --> 00:02:46,650
Okay.

25
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:51,990
And also, we're switching to a 4-5-1 system.

26
00:02:52,070 --> 00:02:56,620
Our worst-case scenario is a draw, so we'll only counterattack.

27
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,290
Okay, understood.

28
00:03:01,330 --> 00:03:05,250
Oh, what's this? Italy has set up the most solid defensive system.

29
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:08,630
They've strengthened their midfield and defense.

30
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:11,550
If only we had a strong forward,

31
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:15,390
we could direct the play around Hernandez more easily.

32
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:20,520
Italy restarts the game.

33
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:26,270
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun are each double-marked.

34
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:28,030
What!?

35
00:03:28,110 --> 00:03:29,530
This formation...

36
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:31,860
Oh.

37
00:03:31,950 --> 00:03:34,160
The Japan team is heating up.

38
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,990
They got the ball back and are pushing forward fast.

39
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,490
Come on, Sawada!

40
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:39,450
Alright! Here, Hyuga-san.

41
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:42,120
Now Sawada-kun gives the ball to Hyuga-kun.

42
00:03:42,210 --> 00:03:44,540
They are Toho's Golden Duo.

43
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:48,550
The distance isn't close at all, but is he going to shoot?

44
00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:51,550
No! He passes!

45
00:03:51,630 --> 00:03:53,300
He sends the ball over the goal!

46
00:03:53,550 --> 00:03:56,300
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun are running onto it.

47
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,510
- Catch them! - Don't let them shoot.

48
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:01,560
Will Japan manage to score this time?

49
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:07,730
Goalkeeper Hernandez-kun jumps and catches it.

50
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:08,730
Gino!

51
00:04:08,820 --> 00:04:11,940
He may have conceded 1 goal, but he's completely calm.

52
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:14,280
He caught the ball calmly and strongly.

53
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,990
He's a wonderful keeper.

54
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:20,750
If we had someone like him, we'd win 100%.

55
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:25,330
God, our only weak point is our keeper.

56
00:04:25,420 --> 00:04:28,880
Wakabayashi must have German citizenship.

57
00:04:29,250 --> 00:04:31,260
You don't need to worry.

58
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:35,340
I heard that he's coming, that legendary keeper.

59
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,260
What!?

60
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:40,350
Are you talking about that legend? The one who's 15 like us,

61
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:44,690
but has never conceded a goal in a professional match?

62
00:04:44,770 --> 00:04:48,650
Are you talking about that genius keeper who lives deep in the Rhineland mountains?

63
00:04:48,730 --> 00:04:50,650
He's coming to this tournament!?

64
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:53,650
Now the ball goes from Conti-kun to Tardelli-kun.

65
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:56,200
Don't underestimate Japan's defense.

66
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,200
Good, here we go.

67
00:04:58,410 --> 00:05:03,540
Oh, Italy can't get past Japan's defense with just one forward.

68
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:07,540
Italy is trying to preserve the draw.

69
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:11,300
Italy didn't account for Misaki's play.

70
00:05:11,590 --> 00:05:14,300
Will Italy settle for a draw?

71
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,680
Whatever, never mind.

72
00:05:16,970 --> 00:05:20,810
They move up to first place in Group D.

73
00:05:21,310 --> 00:05:24,430
Those are the Argentina youth.

74
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:27,480
Italy has completely pulled into a defensive shell.

75
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:30,400
Japan's two midfielders are tightly marked and can't attack.

76
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:33,070
Time is running out.

77
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,740
We can't get anywhere like this.

78
00:05:35,820 --> 00:05:37,950
Should we defenders push forward?

79
00:05:38,490 --> 00:05:40,530
No, we can't panic and push forward now.

80
00:05:40,620 --> 00:05:43,160
I don't want to repeat the mistake from the first half.

81
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,040
Let's be patient a little longer.

82
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,460
Matsuyama.

83
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:51,340
Only 3 minutes left, will it end in a draw?

84
00:05:52,170 --> 00:05:53,800
- Right here. - No.

85
00:05:54,670 --> 00:05:55,720
Tsubasa-san.

86
00:05:55,840 --> 00:06:00,680
Oh, Japan finally gives the ball to Tsubasa.

87
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:02,470
Good, now the game is in our hands.

88
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,470
I will never let it end like this.

89
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,730
The Japan team is on the attack.

90
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:08,770
Great, go forward number 10.

91
00:06:08,850 --> 00:06:11,900
Good luck Japan! Beat Italy!

92
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:16,900
Oh, it seems the crowd didn't really like Italy's defensive play.

93
00:06:16,990 --> 00:06:19,860
The crowd is wildly cheering for Japan.

94
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:24,870
Tsubasa-kun dribbles past, Italy can't stop him.

95
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,000
Tsubasa.

96
00:06:26,410 --> 00:06:27,620
Roberto-san...

97
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:28,870
Catch!

98
00:06:29,460 --> 00:06:32,920
He crosses and Misaki-kun runs toward it.

99
00:06:33,130 --> 00:06:34,130
I want to score!

100
00:06:38,590 --> 00:06:41,640
Misaki-kun goes for a flying overhead kick!

101
00:06:41,930 --> 00:06:44,310
I'll catch it!

102
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:48,940
But goalkeeper Hernandez-kun catches it with one hand.

103
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:50,650
He didn't allow a second goal.

104
00:06:51,900 --> 00:06:54,650
Good, don't underestimate Italy.

105
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:57,150
And he quickly sends the ball forward.

106
00:06:57,240 --> 00:07:00,780
The ball goes directly in front of Japan's goal.

107
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:01,910
What?

108
00:07:02,910 --> 00:07:04,200
Good, let's go forward.

109
00:07:04,490 --> 00:07:06,870
Don't let Gino's pass go to waste.

110
00:07:06,950 --> 00:07:09,830
The Italian youth had done little work so far.

111
00:07:09,910 --> 00:07:12,920
But once again the blue lightning attacks!

112
00:07:13,130 --> 00:07:15,250
Good thing we didn't push forward.

113
00:07:15,340 --> 00:07:18,380
Idiot, say that after you defend.

114
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:22,470
Right, we have to get revenge for them not playing a warm-up match with us.

115
00:07:22,550 --> 00:07:24,680
Now it's time to settle the score.

116
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:29,180
But Japan's defense was waiting to face them.

117
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:32,230
This is Italy's final battle against Japan.

118
00:07:32,810 --> 00:07:34,310
The cheers intensified.

119
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:38,440
The Italian youth are attacking, but Japan has a solid defense.

120
00:07:38,530 --> 00:07:41,110
This Japanese defense...

121
00:07:42,610 --> 00:07:43,870
Impossible!

122
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,490
Take this!

123
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:47,080
Italy shoots under pressure.

124
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,870
Good, it's your turn Wakashimazu.

125
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,120
Okay.

126
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:53,540
But the ball goes straight to goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun.

127
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:59,760
Oh, he didn't catch it, he punched it away.

128
00:08:00,170 --> 00:08:01,470
Go, guys.

129
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:03,510
Just 1 more goal, we still have a chance.

130
00:08:04,140 --> 00:08:07,640
The ball goes from Wakashimazu-kun to captain Tsubasa-kun in midfield.

131
00:08:07,810 --> 00:08:10,520
We defended, the rest is up to you, Tsubasa.

132
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,640
Misaki!

133
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:12,730
Hyuga!

134
00:08:12,810 --> 00:08:13,980
Guys!

135
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:15,150
Alright, let's go forward guys.

136
00:08:15,230 --> 00:08:17,360
One more goal! We can win this.

137
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,270
- Okay! - Okay!

138
00:08:18,650 --> 00:08:20,490
Only 1 minute left.

139
00:08:20,570 --> 00:08:24,280
The Japan youth have staked everything on one last chance.

140
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:29,040
Because of the counterattack, Italy's defense is now weaker.

141
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,540
Come on, let's defend this too! Don't let them score.

142
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:32,540
Okay!

143
00:08:32,790 --> 00:08:36,380
Will the Japan team be able to score the winning goal?

144
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:39,920
Or will Italy defend and salvage the draw?

145
00:08:40,250 --> 00:08:41,800
Hurry up, guys.

146
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,930
There's no time, play faster.

147
00:08:44,130 --> 00:08:47,550
It's impossible for me to concede two goals.

148
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:50,220
The Golden Duo that brought the equalizer to Japan

149
00:08:50,310 --> 00:08:53,060
is attacking once again.

150
00:08:53,230 --> 00:08:54,890
Misaki-kun, there's no time.

151
00:08:54,980 --> 00:08:56,730
We have to do a super fast one-two.

152
00:08:56,810 --> 00:08:58,690
Okay, Tsubasa-kun.

153
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,860
- What? - This! What speed!

154
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:04,200
They pass to each other incredibly fast.

155
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:07,490
Italy's passing might be as fast as lightning...

156
00:09:07,570 --> 00:09:10,030
But these two are white lightning!

157
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,450
Impossible!

158
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,580
Now they're right in front of the goal.

159
00:09:14,660 --> 00:09:17,960
And facing them is the flawless keeper Hernandez-kun.

160
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:19,710
Catch, Tsubasa-kun.

161
00:09:21,710 --> 00:09:25,470
After the pass, Misaki-kun's foot gets tangled with a defender's.

162
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:26,380
Misaki!

163
00:09:26,470 --> 00:09:27,390
Misaki-kun!

164
00:09:27,470 --> 00:09:29,760
But the ball reaches Tsubasa-kun.

165
00:09:29,850 --> 00:09:32,350
The referee doesn't call a foul, play continues.

166
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:35,730
However, Misaki-kun can no longer receive a pass from him.

167
00:09:35,810 --> 00:09:37,980
Damn it, then I'll get past alone.

168
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:39,650
Tsubasa-kun charges in alone.

169
00:09:39,730 --> 00:09:41,230
He dives in alone.

170
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:43,610
For the glorious honor of the Italian team!

171
00:09:43,690 --> 00:09:44,740
We won't let you through.

172
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:50,160
Oh, under pressure, Italy tries to stop him with unfair methods.

173
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:53,080
He pulled Tsubasa-kun's jersey!

174
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:54,000
What!?

175
00:09:54,660 --> 00:09:58,540
I said I'll score... and I will score!

176
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:01,000
I said I'll win and I will win!

177
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:09,260
Tsubasa-kun breaks free and gets past with unwavering determination.

178
00:10:09,430 --> 00:10:10,390
Tsubasa!

179
00:10:10,470 --> 00:10:12,640
Now Torino-kun attacks.

180
00:10:13,770 --> 00:10:18,560
Oh, he flicks the ball up with his heel and keeps running.

181
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:21,400
Tsubasa! That's the technique I showed you before!

182
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:25,110
He slips past the opponent and applies the second phase.

183
00:10:25,190 --> 00:10:27,150
This technique is Tsubasa-kun's specialty.

184
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,280
Tsubasa!

185
00:10:28,530 --> 00:10:32,700
Not only does he slip past, he simultaneously turns his body.

186
00:10:32,780 --> 00:10:33,790
What?

187
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:37,750
And here Tsubasa-kun adds the return shot to it.

188
00:10:37,830 --> 00:10:38,920
This...!

189
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:44,090
Tsubasa-kun transitions from the second technique to his third technique!

190
00:10:44,170 --> 00:10:46,050
All those techniques are incredible.

191
00:10:46,130 --> 00:10:50,050
He's combining two special techniques!

192
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:54,430
And now Tsubasa-kun sends a return shot toward the Italian goal to win!

193
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:56,310
Come on!

194
00:10:58,020 --> 00:10:59,390
Great, Tsubasa.

195
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,020
If he scores, we take the lead.

196
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:02,690
Please, Hernandez.

197
00:11:02,860 --> 00:11:06,190
The ball goes straight to the right corner but Hernandez-kun reacts.

198
00:11:10,660 --> 00:11:11,740
He did it, he deflected it!

199
00:11:11,820 --> 00:11:16,330
Hernandez-kun barely managed to control Tsubasa-kun's return shot.

200
00:11:16,490 --> 00:11:19,410
But the ball drops right in front of Tsubasa-kun again.

201
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:20,870
One goal for victory.

202
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:22,960
I'll shoot until I score.

203
00:11:23,130 --> 00:11:25,090
Tsubasa-kun prepares to shoot once more.

204
00:11:25,170 --> 00:11:26,550
Come on, Tsubasa.

205
00:11:26,710 --> 00:11:28,380
Take this, Hernandez.

206
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:31,050
Tsubasa-kun targets the empty left corner of the goal.

207
00:11:31,130 --> 00:11:34,350
He fires a missile shot with all his strength.

208
00:11:36,350 --> 00:11:40,560
Oh, but Hernandez-kun spreads his hand and dives.

209
00:11:40,810 --> 00:11:43,150
We can't lose, we can't lose!

210
00:11:43,230 --> 00:11:45,150
I am the representative of Italy, a football country.

211
00:11:45,230 --> 00:11:50,820
We are the heirs of a brilliant tradition and we can't lose to anyone.

212
00:11:52,450 --> 00:11:54,200
Oh, and he stops that too.

213
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:58,200
What a keeper! None of Tsubasa-kun's shots become a goal.

214
00:11:58,370 --> 00:11:59,200
Nice!

215
00:11:59,290 --> 00:12:00,710
H-How!

216
00:12:00,910 --> 00:12:03,000
The referee now puts the whistle to his mouth.

217
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,040
This is the end of the game!

218
00:12:05,130 --> 00:12:09,710
Oh, there's someone running wildly toward the rebounding ball.

219
00:12:10,050 --> 00:12:15,260
It's Japan youth's number 9, forward Kojiro Hyuga-kun.

220
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:22,000
Italy Team

221
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:24,300
Hyuga!

222
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:26,010
- Hyuga-san! - Kojiro!

223
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:29,640
This is payback, Italy youth!

224
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:35,730
You disrespected our football and refused our warm-up match.

225
00:12:35,810 --> 00:12:38,190
This is my final shot.

226
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:40,520
Final shot!

227
00:12:41,110 --> 00:12:45,150
I'll stop him. My golden right hand hasn't become useless yet.

228
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,240
I hope you're watching, Coach Kira.

229
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:51,660
I trained with that black ball you sent me, and here's the result!

230
00:12:51,870 --> 00:12:52,870
Catch, here it comes!

231
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:58,080
Neo Tiger Shot!

232
00:12:58,410 --> 00:13:02,460
Hyuga-kun shoots without hesitation!

233
00:13:10,550 --> 00:13:11,550
He stopped it!

234
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:14,310
Hernandez-kun controls the shot again!

235
00:13:14,390 --> 00:13:19,890
The perfect keeper's golden right hand triumphed over Japan until the very last moment.

236
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,280
What?

237
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,530
Hernandez!

238
00:13:30,820 --> 00:13:35,740
Goal! Hyuga-kun's shot completely overpowers Hernandez-kun's golden right hand.

239
00:13:35,830 --> 00:13:38,660
And he opens the Italian goal!

240
00:13:39,370 --> 00:13:42,170
And exactly at that moment the whistle blows and the match ends.

241
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:46,300
Japan youth wins at the very last second!

242
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:48,010
- Hyuga-kun. - Hyuga-san!

243
00:13:48,090 --> 00:13:49,760
You did it, Hyuga.

244
00:13:49,970 --> 00:13:54,800
They won! Japan youth beat Italy youth

245
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:58,100
2-1 at the very last moment!

246
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:04,020
Kojiro Hyuga-kun, Japan's star forward, scored the winning goal.

247
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,520
You guys were great.

248
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:12,530
The sleeping tiger finally awakened and showed his fury.

249
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:15,450
The Italian youth were one of the popular championship contenders.

250
00:14:15,530 --> 00:14:17,540
But they suffered an unexpected defeat.

251
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:19,700
W-We lost.

252
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:22,670
Hernandez conceded 2 goals in one match.

253
00:14:24,170 --> 00:14:26,790
...Despite my golden right hand.

254
00:14:27,590 --> 00:14:28,670
We lost.

255
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:33,340
Those kids weren't in the match they played against us.

256
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:34,300
Yes.

257
00:14:34,390 --> 00:14:36,930
You weren't bad at all, Japan.

258
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:42,940
Your shot was great, Hyuga-kun.

259
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:44,810
That was incredible, Kojiro.

260
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:48,820
Tsubasa, I finally understand.

261
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:53,530
Until now,

262
00:14:53,610 --> 00:14:56,620
especially during these three years in middle school,

263
00:14:56,700 --> 00:14:59,910
I was focused on beating you, that motivated me to play football.

264
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:08,130
But this match helped me realize there's an even stronger keeper.

265
00:15:08,750 --> 00:15:10,130
Hyuga-kun...

266
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:14,430
With the number 9 on my back,

267
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:17,220
I want to set my goal to become the world's number one forward.

268
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,390
Hyuga.

269
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:20,720
Hyuga-san.

270
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:22,600
Yes, Hyuga-kun.

271
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:27,480
And let's make Japan number one someday.

272
00:15:28,110 --> 00:15:29,400
Tsubasa.

273
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:32,650
Tsubasa, not "someday," right?

274
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:37,410
Right, we just beat the favorite Italy.

275
00:15:37,490 --> 00:15:40,030
We have a chance to win this tournament.

276
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:41,200
Right.

277
00:15:41,290 --> 00:15:45,120
We are very different from the team that started this tournament.

278
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:51,250
Right, you're completely different from the team that played in Bremen.

279
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,380
We lost in a glorious way.

280
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:56,380
Hernandez.

281
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,810
Your right hand!

282
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:05,560
Your shot was great, I conceded 2 goals for the first time.

283
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:10,570
I'm sorry we refused the warm-up match in Bremen.

284
00:16:10,650 --> 00:16:11,940
Forgive us.

285
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:20,950
Goodbye, Japan.

286
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:22,950
See you later, Italy.

287
00:16:26,210 --> 00:16:30,630
Italy youth, goalkeeper Gino Hernandez...

288
00:16:31,130 --> 00:16:32,800
He was a true rival.

289
00:16:33,130 --> 00:16:35,340
It's almost weird we scored 2 goals against him.

290
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:39,760
Europe's number one keeper, his golden right hand...

291
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:43,310
We would have never seen him if we hadn't come here.

292
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:46,890
Well done, Japan team.

293
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,980
Good game, Misaki-kun.

294
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:50,690
Guys!

295
00:16:56,990 --> 00:17:00,240
Thank you for supporting us, guys.

296
00:17:03,450 --> 00:17:06,250
Roberto-san, the Japan team...

297
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,830
And Tsubasa won a striking victory.

298
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:12,710
What do you think about watching Tsubasa's game?

299
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:21,220
Even after leaving Japan, using the notebook you left behind,

300
00:17:21,970 --> 00:17:27,430
Tsubasa studied football in the best way and developed his technique.

301
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:34,650
This is what Tsubasa gained from you.

302
00:17:39,740 --> 00:17:42,320
Roberto-san, please see Tsubasa.

303
00:17:42,410 --> 00:17:44,280
You definitely have me confused with someone else.

304
00:17:44,370 --> 00:17:45,410
What?

305
00:17:45,790 --> 00:17:49,410
I'm not Roberto.

306
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:54,880
Roberto-san.

307
00:17:57,710 --> 00:17:59,420
Congratulations, Misaki-kun.

308
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:01,430
Thanks, guys.

309
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:06,220
Misaki-kun was great, but you were really good too, number 10.

310
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:07,810
Th-Thank you.

311
00:18:07,970 --> 00:18:11,100
What's up? Is she your girlfriend, Misaki?

312
00:18:11,190 --> 00:18:13,310
What? She's not.

313
00:18:14,770 --> 00:18:19,030
I'm a third-year middle school student in France, Hayakawa Azumi.

314
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:22,950
I'm supporting Japan with all my strength in this tournament, don't forget me.

315
00:18:24,070 --> 00:18:25,830
She's the French ange, the head of the cheer girls.

316
00:18:25,910 --> 00:18:26,830
No way.

317
00:18:26,910 --> 00:18:32,710
You don't know, Misaki, but that other ange has become very feminine.

318
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:33,710
What?

319
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:37,710
Now they are a wonderful couple.

320
00:18:38,710 --> 00:18:40,840
This can't be, Ishizaki-kun.

321
00:18:41,050 --> 00:18:44,890
You're blushing, Tsubasa.

322
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:51,640
Today is the first day of the National Youth Tournament in France.

323
00:18:51,730 --> 00:18:53,140
The second match,

324
00:18:53,230 --> 00:18:58,690
between Germany youth and Canada youth, will start soon.

325
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:01,360
We have to finish off Germany with a rematch as well.

326
00:19:01,490 --> 00:19:04,950
Let's watch closely to be ready when the time comes.

327
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:05,990
Okay.

328
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:08,240
Surely, the popular favorite of this tournament will win.

329
00:19:08,330 --> 00:19:13,000
What kind of game will we see from the German youth today?

330
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:16,250
Especially from their captain Karl Heinz Schneider?

331
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:18,500
Don't take your eyes off his play.

332
00:19:20,170 --> 00:19:22,420
The whistle blows.

333
00:19:22,420 --> 00:19:26,550
Can the Canadian team surpass Germany?

334
00:19:26,890 --> 00:19:29,680
- Alright, get ready. - We'll beat Germany!

335
00:19:29,890 --> 00:19:32,180
Good luck, Canada youth.

336
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:35,810
Japan beat the Italian team, you surprise us too.

337
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:40,900
However, Germany dominated the game.

338
00:19:40,980 --> 00:19:44,700
Kaltz and Schester completely controlled the midfield.

339
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:49,450
And the two top-level forwards, Margas and Schneider, also played well.

340
00:19:49,530 --> 00:19:50,490
Schneider.

341
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:53,000
Schneider got the ball again.

342
00:19:53,250 --> 00:19:56,000
Fire Shot!

343
00:19:57,670 --> 00:19:59,170
Goal!

344
00:19:59,250 --> 00:20:01,250
A third goal from Schneider.

345
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:06,510
The young emperor Karl Heinz Schneider maintains his reputation.

346
00:20:07,010 --> 00:20:10,050
He just completed the first hat-trick of the tournament.

347
00:20:10,180 --> 00:20:13,390
Wow, Germany is truly incredible.

348
00:20:13,930 --> 00:20:16,270
Canada can only defend.

349
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:20,020
Germany's attack is too strong.

350
00:20:20,570 --> 00:20:23,990
I don't lose, Germany wins.

351
00:20:24,150 --> 00:20:26,610
And I score a hat-trick in every match.

352
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:29,160
Karl Heinz Schneider...

353
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:34,910
Your first rival on the path to becoming the world's best forward.

354
00:20:36,290 --> 00:20:37,250
Yes.

355
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:43,420
With the extraordinary efforts of Schneider and the others, Germany beats Canada 4-0.

356
00:20:43,840 --> 00:20:49,430
And the third match is between Uruguay and Belgium.

357
00:20:49,800 --> 00:20:53,100
God! Following Schneider-kun's hat-trick...

358
00:20:53,180 --> 00:20:56,310
Now we have the second hat-trick of this tournament.

359
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:59,980
He is Uruguay's shooting star, Ramon Victorino.

360
00:21:00,060 --> 00:21:02,570
Wooohoooo! I did it!

361
00:21:02,900 --> 00:21:05,070
S-So fast.

362
00:21:05,490 --> 00:21:07,200
He's a true striker.

363
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:09,160
Who is he?

364
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:15,450
I guess there are strong players all over the world.

365
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,920
And now the end of the match.

366
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:23,090
Uruguay youth, thanks to the efforts of Victorino-kun,

367
00:21:23,170 --> 00:21:25,590
beats Belgium youth.

368
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:30,340
Ramon Victorino is tied with Schneider in the race for top scorer.

369
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:35,100
An unexpected rival for the top scorer title, right, Schneider?

370
00:21:35,930 --> 00:21:38,600
Do you think I'll lose, Kaltz?

371
00:21:38,890 --> 00:21:42,730
No, you don't lose, you'll definitely win.

372
00:21:43,060 --> 00:21:45,110
So far this has been quite a dramatic tournament.

373
00:21:45,190 --> 00:21:48,950
In the next fourth match, the host France youth

374
00:21:49,030 --> 00:21:52,490
will play against England youth, the cradle of football.

375
00:21:52,780 --> 00:21:58,750
France vs England, I'm curious to see how it turns out.

376
00:22:02,710 --> 00:22:04,000
Get ready.

377
00:22:04,340 --> 00:22:06,420
Now it's our turn.

378
00:22:06,500 --> 00:22:07,760
Okay.